Limited Evaluation Purpose

This repository was created as a technical assessment submitted in
connection with a job interview process. Access to this repository is
granted solely so that the receiving organization and its personnel
involved in that hiring process may:

  1. View and run the code to evaluate the author's technical skills
     and the submitted work; and
  2. Discuss the submission internally for the purpose of making a
     hiring decision.

No other use is permitted, including but not limited to:

  - Using the code, in whole or in part, in any product, service, or
    internal tool, whether or not for commercial purposes;
  - Copying, forking, or redistributing the repository or any of its
    contents outside the parties involved in the hiring process;
  - Creating derivative works based on this repository;
  - Using this repository's contents (code, prompts, or documentation)
    as training, fine-tuning, or evaluation data for any machine
    learning or artificial intelligence model or system;
  - Retaining copies of this repository beyond what is reasonably
    necessary for the hiring process described above.

